SYNTAX WHILE
BLOCK
START
POSITION AS loop_start
READ_EXPR AS condition
EMIT_EXPR condition
EMIT_BRANCH_IF_FALSE_COMPLETE
LAST WEND
EXPECT_END
EMIT_BRANCH loop_start
ENDS

SYNTAX DO
BLOCK
START
POSITION AS loop_start
LAST UNTIL
READ_EXPR AS condition
EXPECT_END
EMIT_EXPR condition
EMIT_BRANCH_IF_FALSE loop_start
ENDS
